    'The client is not allowed to use `payment_instruction` object.' => 'Este cliente no está autorizado a utilizar el objeto "payment_instriction".',
    'The currency of the authorization should be same as that in which the Order was created and approved by the Payer. Please check the `currency_code` and try again.' => 'La divisa de la autorización de pago debe ser la misma que la utilizada para crear el pedido y autorizada por el cliente. Comprueba el "código_divisa" e inténtalo de nuevo.',
    'The customer has not approved payment.' => 'El cliente no ha aprobado el pago.',
