    'When a customer returns a product, a credit slip must be created in his favor. Generate vouchers and have a look at their follow-up.' => 'Cuando un cliente devuelve un producto, se debe crear un abono a su favor. Genera cupones de descuento y echa un vistazo a su seguimiento.',
